01-22-e3","era":null,"summary":"The narrator's mother dies of failing health when he is seventeen, leaving him in charge of the farmland.","participants":["narrator-s-mother","vinack-s-stepson"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","order":426,"story_date":"2014-01-22","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":7,"quote":"My mother passed away when I was seventeen and I was then in charge of our farmland.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=My%20mother%20passed%20away,charge%20of%20our%20farmland.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Cowardice of the Hero","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-01-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=My%20mother%20passed%20away,charge%20of%20our%20farmland.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Cowardice of the Hero\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"cowardice-hero-2014-01-22-e5","era":null,"summary":"Vinack returns after ten years asking for help against the minotaurs, and the narrator strikes him.","participants":["vinack","vinack-s-stepson"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","order":426,"story_date":"2014-01-22","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"I would not have struck him if he hadn't said, \"I need your help, Son.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=I%20would%20not%20have,need%20your%20help%2C%20Son.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Cowardice of the Hero","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-01-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=I%20would%20not%20have,need%20your%20help%2C%20Son.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Cowardice of the Hero\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"cowardice-hero-2014-01-22-e6","era":null,"summary":"The narrator agrees to help and Vinack proposes striking down the minotaur oracle.","participants":["vinack","vinack-s-stepson","minotaur-oracle","mogis"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","order":426,"story_date":"2014-01-22","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":24,"quote":"Vinack's plan was to go into their territory and strike down their oracle.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=Vinack%27s%20plan%20was%20to,strike%20down%20their%20oracle.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Cowardice of the Hero","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-01-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#:~:text=Vinack%27s%20plan%20was%20to,strike%20down%20their%20oracle.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Cowardice of the Hero\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"cowardice-hero-2014-01-22-e7","era":null,"summary":"The narrator searches Zerili's home and ledger and concludes that the village secretly pays human tribute and that Vinack means him to die.","participants":["vinack-s-stepson","zerili","vinack"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22","order":426,"story_date":"2014-01-22","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"Vinack meant for me to die.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/cowardice-hero-2014-01-22#: